    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75079" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρίζων</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκλος</span>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οντος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>separating circle</i> (cf. 
